{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29194","headline":"东陵赴京道病东归寓居开元寺寄卢员外宋魏二先辈 · 许浑","name":"东陵赴京道病东归寓居开元寺寄卢员外宋魏二先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风吹雨鴈初时，病寄僧斋罢献书。\n万里咸秦劳我马，四邻松桂忆吾庐。\n沧洲有约心还静，青汉无媒迹自疎。\n不是醉眠愁不散，莫言琴酒学相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}